{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"shared-pipeline","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"CLI, MCP, and direct Python use the same fluent_pipeline services.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/architecture.md","sourceSha256":"41e0bc2e7df744a3a4ef8a83895918507bf9a844764558a41df2027bbceaf482","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"bootstrap-gate","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"The documented workflow starts with bootstrap status and requires project import plus inspection before generation.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/decisions.md","sourceSha256":"0885e0a86cd745de486f91d7eb3e755839da6d7ca7e0bcd7b90ae25f0ef8ad71","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"offline-readiness-boundary","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"Offline ready-to-import validation does not claim Script Editor or hardware readiness.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/known-failures.md","sourceSha256":"7e3131b1b21c7f017e2abf12571dfbdb8166519a27a0d974b02c56cc2b5c458b","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24T00:00:00Z","verifiedBy":"memory-contract-migration"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"driver-command-contracts-adjacent","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"Shallow tecan.driver_macros.v1 stays inventory-only; per-usage DriverFramework parameter contracts live in adjacent tecan.driver_command_contracts.v1 with exact selection or deterministic ambiguity failure.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/decisions.md","sourceSha256":"0885e0a86cd745de486f91d7eb3e755839da6d7ca7e0bcd7b90ae25f0ef8ad71","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"one-shot-service","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"The normal full-export-plus-request path is owned by the shared application_services.run_one_shot service and preserves the existing generation workflow.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/decisions.md","sourceSha256":"0885e0a86cd745de486f91d7eb3e755839da6d7ca7e0bcd7b90ae25f0ef8ad71","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"deterministic-context-compaction","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"Generation-context compaction keeps critical structured evidence atomic, preserves duplicate candidate metadata, records explicit budget accounting and omissions, and supports byte, character, and estimated-token limits.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/architecture.md","sourceSha256":"41e0bc2e7df744a3a4ef8a83895918507bf9a844764558a41df2027bbceaf482","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"repair-delta-safety-boundary","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"Repair-delta generation context includes only implicated diagnostics, source lineage, relevant contracts, and explicitly safe repair actions; full logs and unrelated catalogs are excluded.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/decisions.md","sourceSha256":"0885e0a86cd745de486f91d7eb3e755839da6d7ca7e0bcd7b90ae25f0ef8ad71","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"generation-context-workflow","status":"verified","projectId":"project-31566d61139d1f7557cc","routeIds":["project-memory"],"text":"The shared generation workflow ranks source scripts and mined patterns, emits bounded context artifacts, and carries their fingerprint and review status through IR, manifests, hashes, and packaged reports.","provenance":{"sourcePath":"docs/project-memory/architecture.md","sourceSha256":"41e0bc2e7df744a3a4ef8a83895918507bf9a844764558a41df2027bbceaf482","contractHash":"b0780e20abe839912a7d8ca6b346bd023d9126e5a808367f045b9eb6ee65d7cc","verifiedAt":"2026-09-23T22:15:00Z","verifiedBy":"issue-215"}}
